      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Beef and Meat were two farmers from the 9th century who were tending their
    cattle when the eruption occurred. The corruption fused the farmers with their
    livestock, transforming them into a pair of conjoined Minotaur twins.


    They
    fight alongside Obsticken, Corvus, and Suilla and can act four times per turn,
    with two actions available to each side of their body.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5f8e6024aadc5a046ade11ad5290a252, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -4590058019579560374, guid: 5f8e6024aadc5a046ade11ad5290a252, type: 2}
