  m_text: 'Maria Matsuda is a rebellious 21-year-old performer and member of the
    alternative stage group Celestia. Among her fans, she is known as Moonlit Star,
    a name earned through her striking stage presence and almost ethereal aura.


    As
    corruption spreads, Maria''s appearance progressively changes. Her weapons begin
    to merge with magic and take on increasingly organic forms, while her hair becomes
    more disheveled.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5f8e6024aadc5a046ade11ad5290a252, type: 2}
