  m_text: 'Halt specializes in powerful physical attacks and Bleed. His special abilities
    allow him to apply Taunt and Controlled Instability to himself. His passive grants
    defensive tokens whenever he successfully attacks enemies affected by Bleed.


    His
    four variations alter which aspects of his kit are strengthened, including his
    basic attacks, special abilities, general statistics, and passive.'
