  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Those creatures can deal both single-target and potentially wide-area
    damage. Its special abilities can apply control effects or deal heavy damage
    while potentially restoring its own health. Every time it takes damage, its passive
    permanently increases its damage.


    Its variations determine which control
    effect it applies: Hypnosis, Dizzy, Confusion, or a randomized combination of
    the three.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
