  m_text: Once a renowned knight of Great Britain during the Hundred Years' War,
    Wulfric suffered a defining failure when he was unable to protect his sworn lord,
    who was killed as a result. The event brought him disgrace and left him carrying
    the weight of his guilt. Now he wanders the world in his cracked and battle-worn
    armor, a lasting symbol of both his downfall and his persistence.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
