  m_text: 'The Mimic uses attacks that can apply Bleed, including a powerful special
    attack that guarantees the effect. Its second special attack deals additional
    damage against Bleeding targets.


    Its most distinctive ability is its passive:
    while the Mimic remains on the battlefield, all attacks made by both allies and
    enemies are critical hits.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5f8e6024aadc5a046ade11ad5290a252, type: 2}
