      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'A survivor of the collapse of time itself, the Scavenger has learned to
    survive by exploring the remains of different eras scattered throughout the ruins
    of safe areas. He possesses knowledge and power gathered from these forgotten
    places, but is unwilling to venture into some of the locations himself.


    Instead,
    he offers a portion of his knowledge and power in exchange for relics recovered
    from the places he fears exploring.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5f8e6024aadc5a046ade11ad5290a252, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -4590058019579560374, guid: 5f8e6024aadc5a046ade11ad5290a252, type: 2}
