  m_text: Their attacks focus on area damage and weakening the party. They can apply
    Weaken and Clumsy, while also gaining defensive tokens when an enemy deals less
    than 6 damage to them. Different variations specialize in either stronger basic
    abilities or stronger special attacks.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5f8e6024aadc5a046ade11ad5290a252, type: 2}
