  m_text: 'Corrupted Fairies can apply debuffs to enemies while strengthening themselves
    or their allies with buffs. Their passive grants them a permanent Strength token
    at the end of every round.


    Each variation determines the combination of
    buffs and debuffs they use, including effects such as Burn, Strength, Vulnerability,
    Stealth, Weakness, Regeneration, Corrosion, and Controlled Instability.'
