  m_text: 'DPS variants focus on dealing damage through effects such as Bleed, Burn,
    Exposition, Weakness, Vulnerability, and Corrosion. Support variants use control
    effects and team-wide buffs or debuffs, while Tank variants rely on effects such
    as Taunt, Defense, and Controlled Instability.


    Each Goblin also has a Base
    and General version, with the General version possessing improved statistics.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
