      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Press T to view the Skill Tree. Each character has their own Skill Tree.


    To
    allocate skills, you must purchase levels from the merchant in the village using
    Anomalous Artifacts, which can be collected from combat and chests.


    You
    can allocate up to 12 skills. To unlock an Active Skill from a tier, you must
    first allocate the 3 Passive Skills from that same tier, in any order.


    After
    allocating an Active Skill, the next tier becomes available. Higher-tier skills
    are not necessarily stronger, but are more specialized, allowing you to distribute
    your points across the character''s three branches and create your own build.


    You
    can reset the Skill Tree by spending an Artifact of Return, which can also be
    purchased from the merchant.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5f8e6024aadc5a046ade11ad5290a252, type: 2}
