      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Once an ordinary being, it became fused with an addictive sphere of light.
    It now inhabits a cursed suit of armor that eventually collapses, revealing an
    amorphous mass of flesh. Those who look directly at its unnatural glow risk becoming
    prey to the creature.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
