  m_text: 'In a busy city, there were people so dissatisfied with their appearance
    that they resorted to medication and surgery to change themselves. When corruption
    arrived, their bodies became even more distorted and they completely lost control.


    Now,
    they hunt people they consider exceptionally beautiful, driven by their obsession
    with appearance.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5f8e6024aadc5a046ade11ad5290a252, type: 2}
