  m_text: Once Wulfric's loyal horse, Fitupos was separated from his master during
    the corruption while searching for a revolution. Unfortunately, it did not survive
    the event. What remains is an undead creature inhabiting the horse's destroyed
    body.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
