      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Fitupos can act twice per turn and fights alongside three different Fairies.
    Its abilities include powerful single-target and area attacks, Bleed, Burn, and
    Dizzy. It can also summon a random Fairy and grant permanent Strength buffs to
    itself and its allies.


    Its passive abilities allow it to further strengthen
    buffed allies, recover health when attacking Bleeding enemies, deal additional
    damage to debuffed enemies, and apply Vulnerability to enemies affected by Burn.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5f8e6024aadc5a046ade11ad5290a252, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -4590058019579560374, guid: 5f8e6024aadc5a046ade11ad5290a252, type: 2}
