  m_text: 'Halt was once a cruel warrior who protected a castle by brutally mutilating
    his enemies. After losing his hand and coming into contact with an ancient force,
    he transformed into a monster covered in blood, with bone and metal replacing
    his arms.


    Now consumed by rage, Halt no longer hides the brutality that
    was always part of him.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5f8e6024aadc5a046ade11ad5290a252, type: 2}
