  m_text: 'Use W, A, S, D to move your character. Press Spacebar to interact with
    chests and characters when you are close enough.


    Coming into contact with
    an enemy will initiate combat.


    Press Shift to toggle the torch on or off.
    Enemies can detect you more easily while the torch is lit, but your visibility
    is also reduced when the torch is off.'
