      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The combat HUD shows which of your characters is currently taking their
    turn.


    During your turn, you can click the abilities on the hotbar at the
    bottom of the screen, or use the number keys on your keyboard to select them.


    After
    selecting an ability, choose an enemy as its target.


    Hovering over an ability
    displays a tooltip with information about it. The skill information displayed
    at the bottom of the HUD provides information about the selected skills, including
    their effects as applied to the current target.


    Objective: Defeat all enemies.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5f8e6024aadc5a046ade11ad5290a252, type: 2}
