  m_text: Buck Wyatt is a notorious outlaw known for robbing locomotives, carrying
    out armed robberies, and committing murders. Cunning and resourceful, he once
    led a gang powerful enough to control entire territories and dominate the production
    of moonshine. His reputation and exceptional skill with firearms earned him the
    feared title of El Pistolero.
